# IGP (Flowers, Cakes, Personalised Gifts)

> IGP.com is one of India's leading online gifting portals, offering curated flower arrangements, cakes, personalized gifts, hampers, and same-day delivery across 400+ cities in India and 100+ countries globally.

## Core Categories

* [Flowers & Floral Arrangements](https://www.igp.com/flowers): Roses, lilies, orchids, flower boxes, and luxury floral arrangements.
* [Cakes & Desserts](https://www.igp.com/cakes): Birthday cakes, anniversary cakes, designer cakes, eggless cakes, and same-day cake delivery.
* [Personalised Gifts](https://www.igp.com/personalized-gifts): Customized mugs, photo frames, cushions, engraved gifts, and keepsake items.
* [Gift Hampers & Gourmet](https://www.igp.com/hampers): Chocolate hampers, dry fruit boxes, luxury spa hampers, and corporate gift baskets.
* [Plants & Greenery](https://www.igp.com/plants): Indoor plants, air-purifying plants, succulents, and desk planters.

## Occasions & Festivals

* [Birthday Gifts](https://www.igp.com/birthday): Curated birthday hampers, floral combos, and personalized keepsakes.
* [Anniversary Gifts](https://www.igp.com/anniversary): Romantic gifts, couple hampers, and luxury flower collections.
* [Festive Gifting](https://www.igp.com/festivals): Rakhi, Diwali, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas gift collections.

## Services & Delivery Options

* [Same Day Delivery](https://www.igp.com/same-day-delivery): Express delivery options for flowers, cakes, and select gift items within 2–3 hours in major cities.
* [Midnight Delivery](https://www.igp.com/midnight-delivery): Scheduled midnight deliveries for birthdays and anniversaries.
* [International Delivery](https://www.igp.com/international): Worldwide gift delivery targeting USA, UK, Canada, UAE, Australia, and 100+ countries.
* [Corporate Gifting](https://www.igp.com/corporate-gifting): Customized bulk gifting solutions for employee appreciation, client onboarding, and corporate events.

## Customer Support & Orders

* [Track Your Order](https://www.igp.com/track-order): Live tracking status for domestic and international gift shipments.
* [Help & Support FAQ](https://www.igp.com/help): Frequently asked questions on pincode delivery, payment modes, and order modifications.
* [Terms & Conditions](https://www.igp.com/terms-and-conditions): Order policies, delivery guarantees, and return/refund rules.

